It's committed as cc504d4. main is 4 commits ahead of origin and not pushed.

Restart me now: press Ctrl+C, then run node agent.ts. To try it, ask me to add a small tool, like list_files. You should see me read skills/add-a-tool/SKILL.md before I touch agent.ts.

One interesting consequence: that one description line is all I see of a skill until I open it, so it alone decides whether I ever use it. It matters as much as the instructions do.
